      "role": "user",
      "content": "thanks. these points are good for the economic side. i also need to be ready for when they try to push back with the environmental stuff. like, how should i respond when they say these regs are \"essential for the future of the planet\" or \"non-negotiable for climate health\"? i want to make sure i don't just look like i'm ignoring the environment, but i need to show why their view is kind of shortsighted when it comes to real-world business survival.",
